# The mountains around Balestrand by the Sognefjord. A 20 km box centred on
# the village (Kartverket's place name: 46 km E, 6816 km N). EPSG:25833
# metres, on the 2 km tile grid. (Far west of UTM zone 33's centre, so the
# grid is turned about 7° from true north here; it's still exact, just
# rotated.)
WEST=36000
